# What Ruumble Desk is built from besides this repo. Ruumble itself is the repo root (one directory up).
# Mumble is cloned into work/ from MUMBLE_REPO (a local checkout, relative to desk/) or, if that does not exist,
# from MUMBLE_URL; the checkout is only read. Each value can be overridden from the environment.
MUMBLE_REPO=${MUMBLE_REPO:-../../mumble}
MUMBLE_URL=${MUMBLE_URL:-https://github.com/mumble-voip/mumble.git}
MUMBLE_REF=${MUMBLE_REF:-v1.6.870}
